      "content": "PICCOIT'S END 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   Outbuilding (former                                                   stables) to north-east                                                   of Little Marchmont. TL 0508 3/212 II                       GV 2. Late C18.  Stucco, hipped Welsh slated roof with pedimented central projection to south side elevation.  2 storeys, eaves cornice and frieze.  3 archways, 2 for doors, central panel.  Raised panels and easement windows to 1st floor. Segmental panel in tympanum.                     No 57 (Marchmont House), Little Marchmont, Outbuilding (former stables) and Gate Piers form a group. Listing NGR: TL0477609116"
    }
